Error:
    - Serious problem that occurs in JVM or system
    - best practice : terminate or restart

Exception:
    - problem that occurs due to issue in program logic or external input
    - catch and handle it using "try-catch-finally" block

Exception -- > 1.Checked Exceptions  --> Verified at compile time
                                     --> try-catch or declare using throws
                2. Unchecked Exceptions  --> Occurs ar runtime, not checked at compile time
                                         --> eg: ArrayIndexOutOfBoundry